# KisanSaathi Environment Configuration Template
# Public client settings only. Never prefix private credentials with VITE_.

# Agmarknet / data.gov.in API key is a SERVER SECRET named DATA_GOV_IN_API_KEY.
# Local PowerShell: $env:DATA_GOV_IN_API_KEY = "your-key"; pnpm dev
# Cloudflare Workers: npx wrangler secret put DATA_GOV_IN_API_KEY
# If absent, mandi prices safely fall back to clearly badged demo records.

# Optional: OpenStreetMap / CartoDB custom tile provider URL (defaults to CartoDB Positron / OSM)
VITE_MAP_TILES_URL=

# Application Mode: development | staging | production
VITE_APP_ENV=development
